OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre faces closure under
OL,4,Acouncil plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester City Council has set out
OL,7,Fplans to permanently close the New
OL,8,FParks Leisure Centre.
OL,10,FOfficials said the 51-year-old building
OL,11,Fin St Oswald's Road is the least used
OL,12,Fof the seven leisure centres it runs,
OL,13,Frequires #2.8m of repairs over the next
OL,14,Ffew years, and is no longer financially
OL,15,Fviable.
OL,17,FHowever, the authority has proposed
OL,18,Finvesting #8m to upgrade Leicester Leys
OL,19,FLeisure Centre in Beaumont Leys.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
